:name: DeltaVirtual (single board)
:description: Minimal single-machine run of the deltavirtual Zephyr sample
:             on Renode's nRF52840 platform. Good first sanity check —
:             UART should show "nrf nrf nrf nrf!" once per second.
:
: Run from the deltavirtual folder:
:   renode run.resc

using sysbus

# Writable UICR so Zephyr SystemInit does not reset-loop on NFCPINS.
i @renode/peripherals/UICRStub.cs

mach create "deltavirtual"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/nrf52840.repl
machine LoadPlatformDescriptionFromString """
uicr: Misc.UICRStub @ sysbus 0x10001000
"""

$bin ?= @build/deltavirtual/zephyr/zephyr.elf

showAnalyzer uart0

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""
runMacro $reset

start
